## Reviewer cases

- Reject invalid/non-finite/vertical/zero/excessive event vectors.
- Reject an event keyed to the wrong previous state or Mover frame.
- Reject event data without matching schedule metadata.
- Reject a schedule with zero or multiple event rows.
- Reject event velocity that disagrees with the schedule.
- Reject timed-gate and perturbation schedules in the same episode.
- Reject any contract that declares the future event label as a model input.

## Claim boundary

This accepts the pure causal storage and validation contract. Runtime queuing, exact once-only label
consumption, live schema-v5 export, and measured recovery error remain pending.
